      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Divine Bean Palace’s painting world, Shen Shang tells Fang Di Chang that Divine Bean Palace and Emperor City have already merged into one Immortal Gu House, that Fang Di Chang’s authority over Divine Bean Palace is lower than Genesis Lotus’ will, and that they should shake the house together so Shen Shang can spread human path methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1947
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
